# 🚀 VentureMind AI

> AI-powered business idea validation and analysis platform built with React, FastAPI, Python, and Google Gemini.

VentureMind AI helps entrepreneurs evaluate startup ideas using Generative AI. Users provide information about their business idea, and the platform generates a structured business analysis with actionable recommendations.

## ✨ Features

- 🤖 AI-powered business idea analysis
- 📊 Business viability score
- 💪 Strengths analysis
- ⚠️ Weakness analysis
- 🌱 Opportunities identification
- 🚨 Threat analysis
- 🎯 Target market insights
- 🏆 Competitor insights
- 💰 Revenue strategy
- 📈 Growth strategy
- 💵 Funding readiness
- 🗺️ Business roadmap
- 💡 AI-generated recommendations
- 📱 Responsive user interface
- 🔌 FastAPI REST API
- 📖 Interactive Swagger API documentation

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend
- React
- TypeScript
- CSS
- Axios
- Vite

### Backend
- Python
- FastAPI
- Pydantic

### AI
- Google Gemini API
- Gemini 2.5 Flash

### Tools
- Git
- GitHub
- VS Code
- Python Virtual Environment

